CIBEX accession	CBX62
Release date	2008-08-20

Experiment:
Experiment title	microRNA expression profiling in renal cell carcinoma.
Experimental design type	disease_state_design
Experimental factor	
Common reference	YES
Quality control description	biological_replicate
Number of hybridization	26
Experimental description	To investigate the expression profile of miRNAs in Renal cell carcinoma, and to identify candidate miRNAs showing aberrant regulation of expression.

